<h2>Python 代码示例：多提供商视觉分析</h2>
<p>以下 Python 脚本将图片发送到多个视觉 API（使用 OpenAI 兼容格式）：</p>
<pre><code class="language-python">from openai import OpenAI
import base64, os

# 图片转 base64
with open("invoice.jpg", "rb") as f:
    image_b64 = base64.b64encode(f.read()).decode("utf-8")

messages = [
  {"role": "user", "content": [
    {"type": "text", "text": "提取这张发票中的所有文字，以JSON格式返回。"},
    {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {
      "url": f"data:image/jpeg;base64,{image_b64}"
    }}
  ]}
]

# 提供商1：GPT-4o（通用视觉最佳）
client = OpenAI(api_key=os.environ["OPENAI_API_KEY"])
r = client.chat.completions.create(
  model="gpt-4o", messages=messages,
  response_format={"type": "json_object"}
)
print("GPT-4o:", r.choices[0].message.content[:200])

# 提供商2：FreeModel（聚合器，路由到任意视觉模型）
client = OpenAI(
  base_url="https://freemodel.dev/v1",
  api_key=os.environ["FREEMODEL_API_KEY"]
)
r = client.chat.completions.create(
  model="gpt-4o", messages=messages
)
print("FreeModel:", r.choices[0].message.content[:200])

# 提供商3：Gemini（通过 OpenAI 兼容接口）
client = OpenAI(
  base_url="https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/",
  api_key=os.environ["GEMINI_API_KEY"]
)
r = client.chat.completions.create(
  model="gemini-2.0-flash", messages=messages
)
print("Gemini:", r.choices[0].message.content[:200])</code></pre>

